#: ../../language/error_codes/E0044.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `invalid_inline_wasm`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0044.md:5
msgid "Inline wasm code is invalid."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0044.md:7
msgid "The inline wasm code refers to unbound function."
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0044.md:9
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0044.md:11
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"extern \"wasm\" fn g() =\n"
"  #| (func $g (call $does_not_exist))\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0044.md:15
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0044.md:17
msgid ""
"If you know that such a function exists, manually suppress the warning. "
"Note that a compilation error may result in an [internal compiler "
"error](./E1001.md)."
msgstr ""
"そのような関数が存在すると分かっている場合は、警告を手動で抑制してください。"
"コンパイルエラーが[コンパイラ内部エラー](./E1001.md)につながる可能性がある点に注意してください。"

